  "description": "Retrospective application for the construction of a single storey rear extension, a two storey side extension including addition of an entrance door to the front, a dormer window and a hip-to-gable roof extension to accommodate a rear dormer extension with three roof lights to the front to facilitate conversion of roof space into habitable accommodation",
